# A build artefact: the legacy DeepWiki reducer, sliced out of apps/deepwiki-ui
# by scripts/deepwiki-oracle/extract-jsx-reducer.mjs. Regenerated on demand.
#
# The entry lives HERE, on the branch that first had a working tree containing
# it, rather than only alongside the script that writes it. It was committed by
# accident once — `git add -A` swept it in while it was untracked — and CI then
# linted 245 lines of legacy code as if this repository had written them.
scripts/deepwiki-oracle/jsxReducer.generated.mjs
